{"uid":"bbad72f73d07de58","name":"test_reactivating_a_lapsed_owner_role_member_rechecks_eligibility","fullName":"tests.test_projects#test_reactivating_a_lapsed_owner_role_member_rechecks_eligibility","historyId":"1a81bedc7a24fc5ace6879bbe8da3bf8","time":{"start":1793025871459,"stop":1793025871506,"duration":47},"description":"Review finding on the first version of this PR: `update_project_member`'s\n    eligibility check only fired when the request body explicitly set\n    `role: \"owner\"` -- a status-only reactivation (`{\"status\": \"active\"}`,\n    no `role` field) of a member whose *stored* role was already `owner`\n    skipped the check entirely, since `payload.role` was `None`. That let a\n    secondary Admin, deactivated while eligible and since lapsed, be\n    silently reactivated with full Admin permissions and zero\n    re-verification -- contradicting `is_eligible_for_owner_role`'s own\n    \"checked against live grants, not a snapshot\" contract. This proves the\n    fix: reactivation now re-checks eligibility even with no `role` field\n    in the request.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Review finding on the first version of this PR: <code>update_project_member</code>'s<br />\neligibility check only fired when the request body explicitly set<br />\n<code>role: &quot;owner&quot;</code> -- a status-only reactivation (<code>{&quot;status&quot;: &quot;active&quot;}</code>,<br />\nno <code>role</code> field) of a member whose <em>stored</em> role was already <code>owner</code><br />\nskipped the check entirely, since <code>payload.role</code> was <code>None</code>. That let a<br />\nsecondary Admin, deactivated while eligible and since lapsed, be<br />\nsilently reactivated with full Admin permissions and zero<br />\nre-verification -- contradicting <code>is_eligible_for_owner_role</code>'s own<br />\n&quot;checked against live grants, not a snapshot&quot; contract. This proves the<br />\nfix: reactivation now re-checks eligibility even with no <code>role</code> field<br />\nin the request.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1793024424136,"stop":1793024424137,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1793024428205,"stop":1793024428205,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1793025870597,"stop":1793025870598,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_clear_prompt_info_cache","time":{"start":1793025870597,"stop":1793025870597,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path","time":{"start":1793025870598,"stop":1793025870600,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_tracer_singleton","time":{"start":1793025870598,"stop":1793025870598,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_pricing_source","time":{"start":1793025870598,"stop":1793025870598,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":f